{"version":1,"content":"<p>5元就能解決，居然要收260元。曾被央視3·15晚會點名，公開道歉並承諾全面整改的啄木鳥家庭維修，如今再次陷入「小病大修」爭議。11月10日，河南廣播電視台《小莉幫忙》曝光的一段暗訪視頻引發關注。記者通過換電池、關總閥，找了5家維修師傅上門「維修」燃氣灶，有2位師傅認真負責，只收了30元上門費。另外三位師傅則一通操作，胡亂報價。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585968.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:59:54.419035+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:43:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T14:53:14.097811+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:53:14.097811+00:00","content_hash":"76dc61206da7b392a50c56b2a060877dc7ee166a3eb13a8926e2885d199c2822","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}